WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.060
- I love searching the
internet to find things

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:03.220
that may bring you joy.

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:04.756
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:04.756 --> 00:00:08.040
(crashing music)

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.010
The Florida mama has three children

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.900
born on the same day.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.970
And no, they are not triplets.

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.620
Each, it's crazy.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:19.530
Each was born exactly three
years apart from the next.

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:23.310
Sophia on August 25th, 2015.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:27.290
Giuliana on August 25th, 2018.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:31.484
And their newest baby,
Mia on August 25th, 2021.

00:00:31.484 --> 00:00:34.160
(crowd cheering)

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.973
Now I'm just doing the math.

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.640
November 25th-ish is a magical,

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.392
special time for this couple.

00:00:43.392 --> 00:00:45.070
(audience laughing)

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:48.491
And I hope it's done more
than just on that night.

00:00:48.491 --> 00:00:50.080
(crowd cheering and applauding)

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.100
That's all I'm sayin'.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:54.450
We have them dialed in,
along with their girls.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:59.309
So say hi to Kristin, Nick,
Sophia, Giuliana, and baby Mia.

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:00.142
- Hello!

00:01:00.142 --> 00:01:00.975
- [Kelly] Hi y'all!

00:01:00.975 --> 00:01:01.808
- Hi!

00:01:01.808 --> 00:01:02.641
- Hi!

00:01:02.641 --> 00:01:03.840
- Now this is crazy.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:04.673
So Kristin,

00:01:04.673 --> 00:01:06.940
I guess birthday planning
is pretty awesome though.

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:07.870
You've got it down.

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:09.110
It's the one day.

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.860
- I simplified it for myself, for sure.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:14.590
We just, we're a big Disney family.

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.750
We met working at Disney.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.267
So we do all the Disney themes.

00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:18.470
Make it quite simple.

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:19.668
We come up with a theme.

00:01:19.668 --> 00:01:22.310
Then we just have a big extravaganza.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:23.780
- Oh my gosh, I love Disney.

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:24.760
That's so fun.

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:26.410
That's an amazing
birthday for all of them.

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:29.260
So Sophia, I have to ask, as big sis,

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:31.743
are you okay with sharing your birthday?

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:34.920
- Yeah, it's really cool

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.920
because instead of a little birthday

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.755
we have a big birthday.

00:01:38.755 --> 00:01:40.690
And it's just really
cool to have two sisters

00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:41.790
that really love me.

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:43.363
And it's just really awesome.

00:01:44.619 --> 00:01:48.450
- And we told her when we had Giuliana

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:50.950
that she's getting a best
friend for her birthday.

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:56.260
And then Giuliana and Sophia
get best friends with Mia.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:57.520
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:58.650
You magical little family.

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:00.450
That made me so happy on the inside.

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:02.890
Well, thank you so much for sharing.

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:05.887
I hope y'all have another
magical birthday at Disney.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:08.963
I'm liking y'all's post right now.

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:11.990
And that's not all y'all.

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:14.540
Our season long partner,
Pilot Pen, makers of FriXion,

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:16.500
the go-to erasable pen of
the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.630
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly.

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.300
Y'all are creating
around a particular time.

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.100
And so they're gonna
give you 1,000 dollars

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:25.698
that y'all can use at Disney.

00:02:25.698 --> 00:02:26.531
(crowd cheering)

00:02:26.531 --> 00:02:27.606
- Oh my gosh!

00:02:27.606 --> 00:02:28.614
- Wow!

00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:29.447
- Thank you!

00:02:29.447 --> 00:02:31.640
- I mean, I feel like you
should use some of that

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:33.850
for birthday fun time, is all I'm saying.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:35.182
Thank you guys so much.

00:02:35.182 --> 00:02:36.015
God Bless y'all!

